000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RATTRV01.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE UNDERWRITING SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* RATTRV01  TRAVEL RATING
000600* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AS 'RATTRV01'.
000700* SETS RATE-BASE-PREMIUM FROM THE SUM-INSURED BAND, THEN ADDS
000800* LINE LOADINGS AND DISCOUNTS FROM THE 60-BYTE RISK DETAIL.
000900* BANDS AND RATES ARE THE SAME AS dw.ref_rate_band IN claimsdb.
001000*================================================================
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     COPY RDTRV.
001400 01  WS-BAND                     PIC X(02).
001500 01  WS-PCT                      PIC 9V9999.
001600 LINKAGE SECTION.
001700     COPY POLREC.
001800     COPY RATEREC.
001900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD.
002000 0000-MAIN.
002100     MOVE POL-RISK-DETAIL TO WS-TRV-DETAIL
002200     PERFORM 1000-BASE-RATE
002300     PERFORM 2000-LOADINGS
002400     MOVE ZERO TO RATE-RETURN-CODE
002500     GOBACK.
002600 1000-BASE-RATE.
002700     EVALUATE TRUE
002800         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 5000
002900             MOVE 'B1' TO WS-BAND
003000             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003100                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00832
003200         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 10000
003300             MOVE 'B2' TO WS-BAND
003400             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003500                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00660
003600         WHEN POL-SUM-INSURED <= 25000
003700             MOVE 'B3' TO WS-BAND
003800             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
003900                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00583
004000         WHEN OTHER
004100*            ABOVE THE TOP BAND: RATE AT THE TOP BAND, REFER
004200             MOVE 'XX' TO WS-BAND
004300             COMPUTE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
004400                 POL-SUM-INSURED * 0.00583
004500             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
004600     END-EVALUATE
004700     IF RATE-BASE-PREMIUM < 18.00
004800         MOVE 18.00 TO RATE-BASE-PREMIUM
004900     END-IF.
005000 2000-LOADINGS.
005100     EVALUATE WS-TRIP-TYPE
005200         WHEN 'S'
005300             CONTINUE
005400         WHEN 'A'
005500             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
005600                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.075
005700         WHEN 'M'
005800             COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED =
005900                 RATE-LOADINGS + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.100
006000         WHEN OTHER
006100             SET RATE-REFER TO TRUE
006200     END-EVALUATE
006300     IF WS-DEST-ZONE > 2
006400         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006500             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.200
006600     END-IF
006700     IF WS-MAX-TRIP-DAYS > 31
006800         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
006900             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.150
007000     END-IF
007100     IF WS-TRAVELLERS > 4
007200         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007300             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.050
007400     END-IF
007500     IF WS-WINTER-SPORTS = 'Y'
007600         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
007700             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.125
007800     END-IF
007900     IF WS-OLDEST-AGE > 70
008000         COMPUTE RATE-LOADINGS ROUNDED = RATE-LOADINGS
008100             + RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * 0.100
008200     END-IF.
